<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BORDER 367-9 AT LUNCH TO FREE STATE'S 401.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BORDER 367-9 AT LUNCH TO FREE STATE'S 401.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Border were 367 for nine in reply to Free State's first innings of 401 at lunch on the third day of their Supersport series cricket match at Springbok Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Free State 401 (Kosie Venter 101, Deon Jordaan 68). Border 367-9 (Piet Botha 136, Peter Kirsten 56, Mark Boucher 53).</p>
